 "_readme": "Records a person has read as standing in another country, {id: where}. derive.apply_pin_doubt takes the pin off each (needs-pin, attrs.pinDoubt other-country, the coordinate kept in attrs.pinWas), so the record stays and no map claims it is in Chiang Rai. 2026-10-11: the Mae Sai crossing sits inside the Overture bounding box and the Natural Earth province edge, so Tachileik rows read as Mae Sai. Each id below carries Tachileik or Burmese script in its name or address, or a Taunggyi-Tachileik Road address with a +95 phone, and a pin north of the Sai River (lat above 20.4455). The six named in notes/burmese-shelf-2026-10-11/existing-records-checked.tsv are among them.",
